# The headings and the marks a syllabus of KULASIS writes its books with,
# which fetchSyllabusDetail() looks for with regular expressions; the fuzzer
# cannot learn what a regular expression compares, so it is told. The tokens
# are UTF-8, which the target's first byte picks one time in five.

